1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,121
你的 agent 說：做完了。
Your agent says: done.

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:04,200
真的嗎？
Is it, though?

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:07,120
以前，你還得自己一步步追究。
Until now, you had to audit it yourself — step by step.

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:10,797
Vacant。裝一次，照常用。
Vacant. Install once. Use your agent as usual.

5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:14,900
接上 pi、Claude Code、OpenCode、Codex。
Hooks into pi, Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex.

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,594
不用契約、設定、金鑰。
No contract. No config. No keys.

7
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:20,400
每一步，都簽進一條雜湊鏈。
Every step is signed into a hash chain.

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:24,487
沒問題時，請求和沒裝時逐位元組相同。
When nothing is wrong, requests are byte-identical to no install.

9
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,800
直到 agent 說：做完了。
Until the agent says: done.

10
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,200
Vacant 只看紀錄，查五件事：
Reading only the record, it checks five things:

11
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:35,500
檔案沒寫、失敗被略過、測試對不上、數字沒出處、點名的檔沒打開。
missing file · skipped failure · test claim mismatch · unsourced number · named file never opened

12
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,862
有問題，交給你之前就退回去補。
If something is off, it goes back — before it reaches you.

13
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:43,609
交件附上：查了什麼、改了什麼、還沒驗證什麼。
Delivered with a note: what was checked, what changed, what is unverified.

14
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:48,200
預註冊實測，十五回合上限下：四十二到五十三。
Pre-registered test, 15-turn cap: 42% → 53%.

15
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:51,300
補回的，是說做完卻沒寫的答案。
Recovered: answers called done, but never written.

16
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:54,753
它不判斷對錯，只確認每一步有根據。
It doesn't judge right or wrong. It checks every step has grounds.

17
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:58,858
Vacant。讓每一次交付，都有根據。
Vacant. Every delivery, grounded.
